{"id":"u124","kelas":"travel","no":3,"judul":"Di Restoran dan Memesan","title":"Restaurants and Ordering","emoji":"🍽️","ringkas":"Menu, memesan, alergi, tagihan, dan tip","ready":true,"goals":["memesan makanan dengan sopan: *I'd like ...*, *Could I have ...?*","menyebut **alergi, diet, dan tingkat kematangan**","meminta **tagihan** dan memahami tip","mengenali bagian **menu**: starter, main course, dessert"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di restoran luar negeri kamu perlu membaca menu, memesan, dan meminta tagihan. Gunakan **I'd like ...**, **Could I have ...?**, dan **Could we have the bill, please?**"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Menu dan pesanan","items":[{"en":"menu","id":"daftar makanan","ex":"Could I see the menu, please?"},{"en":"starter","id":"hidangan pembuka","ex":"I would like a soup as a starter."},{"en":"main course","id":"hidangan utama","ex":"For the main course, I'll have the chicken."},{"en":"dessert","id":"hidangan penutup","ex":"We would like to see the dessert menu."},{"en":"special","id":"menu spesial hari ini","ex":"What is today's special?"},{"en":"order","id":"memesan / pesanan","ex":"Are you ready to order?"},{"en":"side dish","id":"lauk pendamping","ex":"Could I have a side dish of rice?"},{"en":"recommend","id":"menyarankan","ex":"What do you recommend?"}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Preferensi dan alergi","items":[{"en":"vegetarian","id":"vegetarian","ex":"I am vegetarian."},{"en":"allergic","id":"alergi","ex":"I am allergic to peanuts."},{"en":"spicy","id":"pedas","ex":"Is this dish spicy?"},{"en":"rare","id":"setengah matang","ex":"I would like my steak rare."},{"en":"well done","id":"matang sempurna","ex":"I'd like it well done."},{"en":"sparkling water","id":"air berkarbonasi","ex":"A bottle of sparkling water, please."},{"en":"without","id":"tanpa","ex":"Could I have it without onions?"},{"en":"gluten-free","id":"bebas gluten","ex":"Do you have any gluten-free dishes?"}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Tagihan dan pembayaran","items":[{"en":"bill","id":"tagihan","ex":"Could we have the bill, please?"},{"en":"tip","id":"uang tip","ex":"Is the tip included?"},{"en":"service charge","id":"biaya layanan","ex":"There is a ten percent service charge."},{"en":"split the bill","id":"membagi tagihan","ex":"Can we split the bill?"},{"en":"by card","id":"dengan kartu","ex":"Can I pay by card?"},{"en":"change","id":"uang kembalian","ex":"Keep the change."},{"en":"takeaway","id":"dibawa pulang","ex":"Can I have this as takeaway?"},{"en":"table for two","id":"meja untuk dua orang","ex":"A table for two, please."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Memesan makanan","lines":[{"who":"Waiter","en":"Good evening. Are you ready to order?","id":"Selamat malam. Sudah siap memesan?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes. I'd like the chicken soup as a starter.","id":"Ya. Saya mau sup ayam sebagai pembuka."},{"who":"Waiter","en":"And for the main course?","id":"Dan hidangan utamanya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"The fish, please. Is it spicy?","id":"Ikannya, tolong. Apakah pedas?"},{"who":"Waiter","en":"No, it is mild.","id":"Tidak, rasanya ringan."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Great. And could we have the bill later, please?","id":"Bagus. Dan bisakah kami minta tagihan nanti?"}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Pola sopan: *I'd like ...* untuk memesan, *Could I have ...?* untuk meminta, *Is ... included?* untuk bertanya biaya."},{"t":"summary","items":["Menu dan pesanan: [[menu]], [[starter]], [[main course]], [[dessert]], [[special]], [[order]].","Preferensi dan alergi: [[vegetarian]], [[allergic]], [[spicy]], [[rare]], [[well done]], [[sparkling water]].","Tagihan dan pembayaran: [[bill]], [[tip]], [[service charge]], [[split the bill]], [[by card]], [[change]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"menu\"?","options":["daftar makanan","alergi","biaya layanan","hidangan pembuka"],"answer":0,"exp":"menu = daftar makanan.","k":"cb4e9722"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"daftar makanan\" adalah...","options":["menu","side dish","